# Codebase Language Rule

All code, comments, documentation, variable names, function names, commit messages, and all other written content in the codebase must be written exclusively in English.

**Purpose:**
- Ensures consistency and accessibility for all contributors.
- Facilitates collaboration in international teams.
- Makes onboarding and code reviews easier for non-native speakers of other languages.

> **Note:** Code or comments in other languages are not permitted and should be refactored to English as soon as possible.
